tabletkeyboard: tabletkeyboard (on-screen keyboard for X11)
tabletkeyboard:
tabletkeyboard: A floating, focusless on-screen keyboard that injects keys
tabletkeyboard: through the XTEST extension, so input methods (fcitx5),
tabletkeyboard: applications and shortcuts behave exactly as they do for the
tabletkeyboard: physical keyboard. Layouts and themes are plain JSON (us and
tabletkeyboard: jp106 sets are bundled), a system-tray icon gives quick
tabletkeyboard: access, and no root privileges, fcitx5 changes or window
tabletkeyboard: manager configuration are required.
tabletkeyboard:
tabletkeyboard: Requires qt5 and libXtst.
